# A Testing Time (Windurst 2-2). Janshura-Rashura plays 78 (the finish with option 0 does nothing, option 4 begins the
# mission; the next trigger plays the section-2 event 133). Moreno-Toeno plays 182 (the finish with option 1 does
# nothing, option 2 starts the window and gives the key item), then 183 (too early; 2 hours left at the second one), a
# failed run's 198 (3 kills), and, after the fail, Teacher's Pet's 437 (its finish writes windurst.teachers_pet step 1
# and Quest[2][28]Prog 1), then its 438 after a zone (its finish sets windurst.teachers_pet to status 1, accepted). A
# retry: Janshura 78 begins again, Moreno plays 181 (option 1 does nothing, option 2 starts the window again).
lists PortWindurst/Janshura-Rashura/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/78 WindurstWaters/Moreno-Toeno/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/181 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/182 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/198
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-227,-8,182 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
login
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed   # a GM: 1-1 done
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter current
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed          # a GM: 1-2 done
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace current
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed              # a GM: 1-3 done
mission Windurst LostForWords current
mission Windurst LostForWords completed                 # a GM: 2-1 done
trigger Janshura-Rashura                # 78
finish option=0                         # not 4: nothing
trigger Janshura-Rashura                # 78
finish option=4                         # begun
trigger Janshura-Rashura                # section 2: 133
finish
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # status 1
finish option=1
warp -227,-8,182 PortWindurst           # zoned: his event plays as a first
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # status 1
finish option=2
warp -227,-8,182 PortWindurst           # zoned: his event plays as a first
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # status 2, 24 hours to go
finish
charvar Mission[2][4]EndTime 790189345        # a GM: one second past the hour window
warp -227,-8,182 PortWindurst           # zoned: his event plays as a first
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # too early
finish
charvar Mission[2][4]EndTime 790189344        # a GM: the hour window
charvar Mission[2][4]KillCount 3              # a GM: the kills
warp -227,-8,182 PortWindurst           # zoned: his event plays as a first
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # too few kills: fails
finish
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # after the fail: Teacher's Pet's 437
finish
warp -227,-8,182 PortWindurst           # zoned: his event plays as a first
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # zoned: Teacher's Pet's 438
finish
warp -227,-8,182 PortWindurst           # zoned: his event plays as a first
trigger Janshura-Rashura                # 78
finish option=4                         # begun
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # status 1, a retry
finish option=1
warp -227,-8,182 PortWindurst           # zoned: his event plays as a first
warp 169,-1,160 WindurstWaters
trigger Moreno-Toeno                    # a retry accepted
finish option=2
